  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Duluth, United States, Hiba stands out as a distinguished tattoo artist, revered for their exemplary cleanliness in practice. Specializing in custom work and always eager to take on new bookings, clients are consistently impressed by the sterile environment and the meticulous attention to hygiene Hiba upholds in their studio in Johns Creek, Georgia. With a strict protocol that includes a non-refundable deposit, Hiba ensures that every client receives top-quality service in a spotlessly clean setting.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Duluth, Georgia, United States\n\n⊹ illustrative realism, surrealism, blackwork\n⊹ books open for april-may\n⊹ booking form link below\n🪬main: @hibakhanart\n\n⊹ illustrative realism, surrealism, blackwork\n⊹ books open for may-june\n⊹ booking form link below\n🪬main: @hibakhanart",
